<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div>Thank you for your interest in the Executive Master of Public Administration (EMPA) degree at Arizona State University. You can review <a href="https://ramseyexecutive.asu.edu/content/executive-mpa">our site</a> for details about the program, including schedule, costs, and degree requirements.&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please note the application deadline is <b>March 15</b>.&nbsp;</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>If you have any questions, please contact <a href="mailto:hector.zelaya@asu.edu">Hector Zelaya</a>, Director, Bob Ramsey Executive Education, at hector.zelaya@asu.edu or 602-496-1308.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Thank you,</div><div>Linda</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Linda Hess, M.Ed., CPM</div><div>Operations Manager, Bob Ramsey Executive Education</div><div>School of Public Affairs | Arizona State University&nbsp;</div><div>602-496-1305</div><div><a href="http://ramseyexecutive.asu.edu/">ramseyexecutive.asu.edu</a> | <a href="http://ramseyexecutive.asu.edu/content/executive-mpa">Executive MPA Program</a> | <a href="http://ramseyexecutive.asu.edu/content/cpmprogram">CPM Program</a></div><div><br></div></font></div>]]></td>
